          "Report what moved, what did not, and what remains unknown. That final sentence is the honest close of a measurement protocol. It is more useful than a precise-looking rate built on an unclear denominator. The goal is a reviewable decision, not a perfect number.",
          "The offboarding access removal completion sample includes at least one case from each active channel. HR Coordinators records the channel and arrival date for every case in the extract. If a channel is missing, the report says so and explains the access limit. Silence about an excluded channel makes the result look stronger than it is."
