          "This offboarding access removal completion protocol measures evidence quality, not the merits of an employment decision. A complete file does not prove that the decision was fair, lawful, or correct. HR Coordinators keeps the public sources beside the finding because they describe general recordkeeping duties, not a result for this sample. The report should state that boundary in plain language.",
